    "toolPreparation": "Whole unchanged packages/ai/src/utils/validation.ts validateToolArguments on the actual retained original definition/schema. Pure handle-free owner-admitted initial preparation; receives no host context. Source before/after and schema observations retained. No replacement validation after tool_call hooks.",
